00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:43.000
Käige perse! Te olete kõige
nõmedamad geid, keda ma tean!

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.000
Ta on soovoolav!

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:49.000
Teate, mis teie häda on?
Sina usud,

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:53.000
